hten the refutation's basis with the corrected membership behavior. The hint-carrying heartbeat addresses votingMembers(), the union of remotes and witnesses, so witnesses are legitimate acknowledgement sources and are counted in the same quorums as voters, while observers only ever receive a zero context and a sender outside every role map is dropped by the lw lookup. That makes the observer branch harmless without denying that lw admits it, and keeps the measured removed-voter and unknown-sender results as the decisive evidence. The conclusion and defect claim are unchanged.\\\",\n \\\"interpretations\\\": [u]\n}\njson.dump(out, open('draft/update.json','w'), indent=2)\nopen('draft/update.json','a').write(\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nPY\ncd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance && .venv/bin/consensus-assurance validate --run runs/2026-10-18_14-39-49-dragonboat_raft-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | tail -4\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
